msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"Don't the bars in Kamurocho trick you into paying ridiculous fees? I'm "
"scared to go out..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"You don't have to worry about that anymore! That kinda thing hardly ever "
"happens now. There aren't many pesky barkers around, either."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Yeah. I feel totally safe going out at night lately. Do you think it's "
"'cause the police have been cracking down on everything?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"I heard that it's because the yakuza family in charge of Kamurocho has a "
"new boss. They say he won't allow illegal activities anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Really? I had no idea yakuza like that even existed. Maybe it is safe to go "
"out..."
msgstr ""

